I really like this initiative :)


A friend of mine is working on speech recognition (for other purposes) and =
tried Sphinx but ended up changing to http://kaldi.sourceforge.net/about.ht=
ml, I believe because he found it to be better at recognising speech and/or=
 it was faster. I thought I'd mention it in case you're not fully set on Sp=
hinx.

